window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>The celestial rulers need human women to prevent the end of their alien civilization. Their human agents, working nonstop to recruit suitable mates, will stop at nothing to accomplish their purpose. That purpose is simple. Pair beautiful, fertile women with multiple extraterrestrial men. If you’ve ever wondered what it would mean to have a male harem available to you, maybe you’ll be fortunate enough to find out. Keep your eyes and ears open because the universe is closer than you think.</i></b></p> <p>When I walk in on my best friend having sex, it’s shocking as can be. I guess the fact that the man she’s with is perfect and… Well, I can’t see all of him, but I see a particular part of him, and it’s really, really big! I don’t understand why he’s wearing body paint and I guess they’re just roleplaying or something. I’m about to discover that he’s not wearing paint at all. He’s an alien and she’s married to three of them! That’s not it. There are three aliens ready for me as well, and ready or not, here they come!</p>"; 
